WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:22.371
"The water feels nice!" Dipper said.

2
00:00:22.372 --> 00:00:26.179
"You should come out," Jeb said.

3
00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:29.320
"Yeah," Eddy said.

4
00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:32.390
"Ms. Fender will be mad."

5
00:00:32.391 --> 00:00:35.832
But Dipper didn't listen.

6
00:00:35.833 --> 00:00:39.851
She went in even deeper.

7
00:00:39.852 --> 00:00:47.491
Poppy went closer to the water.

8
00:00:47.492 --> 00:00:50.458
The others followed.

9
00:00:50.459 --> 00:00:53.839
Brumm, brumm!

10
00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:57.351
Gasser splashed into the water.

11
00:00:57.352 --> 00:01:06.276
Everyone laughed.

12
00:01:06.277 --> 00:01:10.613
Jeb scooped some water.

13
00:01:10.614 --> 00:01:18.428
Eddy dipped his tire.

14
00:01:18.429 --> 00:01:21.963
"I'm going in," Zippy said.

15
00:01:21.964 --> 00:01:24.858
He drove into the waves.

16
00:01:24.859 --> 00:01:27.768
"Me too!" Jeb said.

17
00:01:27.769 --> 00:01:32.603
He splashed into the water.

18
00:01:32.604 --> 00:01:36.832
Poppy went in next.

19
00:01:36.833 --> 00:01:44.357
"Come on, Eddy!" she said.

20
00:01:44.358 --> 00:01:49.982
Eddy went in.

21
00:01:49.983 --> 00:01:53.251
"This is fun!" he said.

22
00:01:53.252 --> 00:02:06.304
Everyone splashed and played.

23
00:02:06.305 --> 00:02:10.357
Pop!

24
00:02:10.358 --> 00:02:12.834
"Uh-oh!" Eddy said.

25
00:02:12.835 --> 00:02:15.599
"My engine stopped!"
